<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Temporary Password</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
      .password-box { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background: #fff3cd; color: #856404; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; border: 1px dashed #ffeeba; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 20px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; }
      .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 15px; }
      .warning { color: #dc3545; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Your Hub Manager Account - System Generated Password</h2>
      <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
      <p>Your Hub Manager application has been approved. Below is your system generated password to log in:</p>

      <div class="password-box"><%= password %></div>

      <p class="warning">Important: For your security, you will be required to set a new password immediately after your first login.</p>
      <p>If you did not apply for this role, please ignore this email or contact support.</p>

      <div class="footer">
        &copy; Courier &amp; Logistics Management System. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>